Subject: [PATCH] feat: add bilingual Negocio Listo landing with lead capture

- /negocio-listo (ES) and /en/negocio-listo (EN) with the owner reels in a
  phone-frame player, plan copy from the Negocio Listo graphics, FAQ and
  video transcript
- Lead popup (desktop after 3 s, mobile bottom sheet after scroll) and an
  inline form posting to POST /api/outreach/public-lead (new route on the
  existing outreach function): inbound leads row owned by the workspace
  owner, honeypot + min fill time, 30-min same-phone merge, no external action
- Build-time prerender bakes title, OG, canonical, hreflang and JSON-LD
  (Service offers, VideoObject, FAQPage) into per-route HTML; Vercel rewrites
- Sitemap and llms.txt entries; intro loader skipped on these routes

